<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from a typical slaughter steer for today was estimated at $8.55 per cwt live, up 0.01 when compared to Thursday's value. - USDA</p>
<p>FOB CENTRAL U.S. TODAY'S CALCULATIONS FOR BY-PRODUCT VALUE</p>
<p>(STEER) -			   Lbs   Price  Change   Value</p>
<p>Steer hide, butt brand	 4.96   79.00    -	 5.02</p>
<p>Tallow, edible		   1.20   21.25    0.50    0.26</p>
<p>Tallow, packer bleachable    4.50   18.75    -	 0.84</p>
<p>Tongues, Swiss #1 Wht 0-3%   0.26  160.00    -	 0.42</p>
<p>Cheek meat, trmd		 0.32   68.00    -	 0.22</p>
<p>Head meat			  0.13   58.00    -	 0.08</p>
<p>Oxtail, selected		 0.16  143.00    -	 0.23</p>
<p>Hearts, reg, bone out	  0.38   28.00    -	 0.11</p>
<p>Lips, unscalded		  0.11   68.50    -	 0.08</p>
<p>Livers, slcted, gall off     0.96   38.00    -	 0.36</p>
<p>Tripe, scalded edible	  0.65   20.00    -	 0.13</p>
<p>Tripe, honeycomb bleached    0.15   47.00    -	 0.07</p>
<p>Lungs, inedible		  0.47    4.60    -	 0.02</p>
<p>Melts				0.14    6.25    -	 0.01</p>
<p>Meat bone ml, 50% blk/ton    3.70  280.00    1.00    0.52</p>
<p>Blood meal, 85% blk/ton	0.60  595.00   -5.00    0.18</p>
<p>TOTAL :			   18.69			  8.55</p>
<p>The average value of hide and offal for the five days ending Friday, June 6, 1997 was estimated at 8.57 per cwt., down -0.09 from last week and up 0.17 from last year. ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
